Description: Qt + Matplotlib microscopy keypoint annotation IDE
 Phage Annotator is a keypoint annotation GUI for 2D/3D/time microscopy
 TIFF stacks, with assistive suggestion review, reproducible project
 persistence, and dock-based expert UX. This package bundles its own
 Python runtime and scientific-stack dependencies (numpy, scipy,
 scikit-learn, scikit-image, pandas, PyQt5) so it does not depend on or
 conflict with any Python environment already on the system; it only
 depends on system Qt/X11 shared libraries.
